    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds like a solid plan. i'm also worried about the kitchen side of things—sometimes things get chaotic during service and instructions get lost in the shuffle. do you have any tips for how to organize the actual prep sheets or the way the chefs talk to each other during the rush so these specific dietary needs don't get overlooked?",
